OL,3,GNEWSAEstimated A66 upgrade bill doubles
OL,4,Ato #2.7bn
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project to dual the A66 road, which
OL,7,Fruns across northern England linking
OL,8,FCumbria, County Durham and Yorkshire,
OL,9,Fmay end up costing more than double its
OL,10,Finitial estimate, according to National
OL,11,FHighways.
OL,13,FThe agency said the scheme's projected
OL,14,Fcurrent cost was about #2.67bn. This is
OL,15,Fmore than double the project's initial
OL,16,F#1.3bn estimate.
OL,18,FNational Highways said the figure was
OL,19,Fnot final and still subject to change.
OL,20,FThe Department for Transport (DfT) has
OL,21,Fbeen approached for comment.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
