OL,3,GNEWSAEstimated A66 upgrade bill doubles
OL,4,Ato #2.7bn
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast month DfT said the dualling
OL,7,Fproject would take nine years instead
OL,8,Fof the five it was initially slated to
OL,9,Ftake.
